editor_description = "THE ARENA'S LIGHT: one gold point in the lantern, shadowed, so the eight windows throw their beams across the ring as the drawing has them. Colour, energy, range, attenuation and height come from marble_tower_light_profile.tres; the light_* properties here are placeholders for the editor view."
